FIRST TIME
-----------------
1. Install pips:      pip install -r otherfilez\requirements.txt
2. Pull a model:      ollama pull qwen2.5:3b-instruct
3. Start Ollama:      ollama serve   (leave running in another window)
4. Open /settings → click "Refresh data now" (crawls + builds index)

