TROUBLESHOOTING
===============

"Answer wrong/hallucinated"
  1. Open /settings, click "Rebuild index only" — refresh the whole KB.
  2. Raise Top-K + Final contexts.
  3. Enable the MiniLM reranker.
  4. Lower Date half-life to 120.

"Answer says it couldn't find something you know is in the docs"
  1. The exact phrasing might not be in the retrieved chunks.
     Try rephrasing the query with the exact keywords from the document.
  2. Raise "Contexts fed to LLM" to 12.
  3. Enable reranker.
  4. If it's a person's number/email, ensure the doc containing it is in
     the top contexts — check by clicking the Sources button.

"Sources button still shows on my messages"
  Should be fixed in this update. If not, hard-refresh the browser
  (Ctrl+F5) to bust the cached HTML.

"Retrieval returns 2017 or 2018 notices for a 2026 query"
  Lower Date half-life to 120. This makes old docs decay much faster.

"First answer takes 90 seconds"
  model loading + Ollama cold start. Second answer will be 30-60s.


